          "failureScenario": "metadata.downloadPlaceNames reads a `base` parameter (the download address, line 221) and rejects non-https values with \"`base` must be an https:// address\". Its published contract (line 286) declares only `{dataset?: folder}` and states the data comes from download.geonames.org. Schema-driven callers cannot know the parameter exists, and the contract's claim about the source is not enforced by the implementation.",
          "action": "Either remove `base` from the release command surface or add it to the contract with its constraints.",
